# Everything in the repository is line-feed, whoever commits it. The generated
# files are written with LF and compared byte for byte, so the checkout must not
# rewrite them - which also keeps a diff free of whole-file line-ending churn.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary artefacts that may end up next to a build, or a copied real DLL for
# export comparison: never touched.
*.dll binary
*.lib binary
*.exp binary
*.exe binary
*.pdb binary
*.png binary
*.ico binary
